#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_ABANDONED_WAREHOUSE_DESC"
msgstr "A half-ruined warehouse stands by the road. Chests glimmer inside, but the rotten floor barely holds."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_ABANDONED_WAREHOUSE_OPTION_1"
msgstr "Search the warehouse"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_ABANDONED_WAREHOUSE_OPTION_2"
msgstr "Don't risk it"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_ABANDONED_WAREHOUSE_RESULT_1"
msgstr "A pouch of coins was found under the floorboards."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_ABANDONED_WAREHOUSE_RESULT_2"
msgstr "The floor collapsed, and some supplies had to be abandoned."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_ABANDONED_WAREHOUSE_RESULT_3"
msgstr "You leave the unreliable building behind."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_ABANDONED_WAREHOUSE_TITLE"
msgstr "Abandoned Warehouse"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_ANCIENT_ALTAR_DESC"
msgstr "An altar with two bowls — stone and crystal — stands amid the ruins. The runes demand an offering."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_ANCIENT_ALTAR_OPTION_1"
msgstr "Put 10 gold in the stone bowl"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_ANCIENT_ALTAR_OPTION_2"
msgstr "Put 7 gold in the crystal bowl"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_ANCIENT_ALTAR_OPTION_3"
msgstr "Leave the altar alone"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_ANCIENT_ALTAR_RESULT_1"
msgstr "The runes strengthen your Tower's foundation."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_ANCIENT_ALTAR_RESULT_2"
msgstr "The crystal fills your magical channels with new power."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_ANCIENT_ALTAR_RESULT_3"
msgstr "You decide not to awaken the ancient power."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_ANCIENT_ALTAR_TITLE"
msgstr "Ancient Altar"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_BEAST_AUCTION_DESC"
msgstr "Nomads are selling war beasts. Nearby lies a cheap egg of unguaranteed origin."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_BEAST_AUCTION_OPTION_1"
msgstr "Hire an orc for 7 gold"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_BEAST_AUCTION_OPTION_2"
msgstr "Buy the mysterious egg for 4 gold"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_BEAST_AUCTION_OPTION_3"
msgstr "Don't participate"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_BEAST_AUCTION_RESULT_1"
msgstr "The orc accepts payment and joins your ranks."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_BEAST_AUCTION_RESULT_2"
msgstr "A young beast hatches from the egg, along with a Beast Hunter."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_BEAST_AUCTION_RESULT_3"
msgstr "A feisty goblin hatches from the egg."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_BEAST_AUCTION_RESULT_4"
msgstr "You leave the noisy auction."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_BEAST_AUCTION_TITLE"
msgstr "Beast Auction"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_BEAST_DEN_DESC"
msgstr "A pack hides in the ravine. Good bait would let you tame it, but you could risk it unprepared."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_BEAST_DEN_OPTION_1"
msgstr "Buy bait for 6 gold"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_BEAST_DEN_OPTION_2"
msgstr "Sneak up to the den"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_BEAST_DEN_OPTION_3"
msgstr "Go around the ravine"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_BEAST_DEN_RESULT_1"
msgstr "The pack accepts you as its leader."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_BEAST_DEN_RESULT_2"
msgstr "An experienced beast hunter comes out to meet you and joins you."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_BEAST_DEN_RESULT_3"
msgstr "The beasts ransack your supply bag."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_BEAST_DEN_RESULT_4"
msgstr "You don't disturb the pack."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_BEAST_DEN_TITLE"
msgstr "Beast Den"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_COLLAPSED_MINE_DESC"
msgstr "The clink of pickaxes can be heard beyond the rubble. The miners promise to share their knowledge or the gold they found."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_COLLAPSED_MINE_OPTION_1"
msgstr "Hire workers for 6 gold"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_COLLAPSED_MINE_OPTION_2"
msgstr "Look for a way around yourself"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_COLLAPSED_MINE_OPTION_3"
msgstr "Don't linger"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_COLLAPSED_MINE_RESULT_1"
msgstr "The passage is cleared, and the miners improve your Quarry."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_COLLAPSED_MINE_RESULT_2"
msgstr "A stash is found in a side tunnel."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_COLLAPSED_MINE_RESULT_3"
msgstr "A new collapse damages some of your equipment."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_COLLAPSED_MINE_RESULT_4"
msgstr "You leave the mine behind."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_COLLAPSED_MINE_TITLE"
msgstr "Collapsed Mine"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_DICE_GAME_DESC"
msgstr "A game for gold is underway at the roadside tavern. The host offers a normal or a high stake."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_DICE_GAME_OPTION_1"
msgstr "Bet 5 gold"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_DICE_GAME_OPTION_2"
msgstr "Bet 10 gold"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_DICE_GAME_OPTION_3"
msgstr "Don't play"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_DICE_GAME_RESULT_1"
msgstr "The dice favor you: you take the winnings."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_DICE_GAME_RESULT_2"
msgstr "The roll fails, the bet is lost."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_DICE_GAME_RESULT_3"
msgstr "A rare combination brings a big payout."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_DICE_GAME_RESULT_4"
msgstr "The opponent wins your bet."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_DICE_GAME_RESULT_5"
msgstr "You keep your gold and leave the tavern."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_DICE_GAME_TITLE"
msgstr "Dice Game"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_DWARVEN_CARAVAN_DESC"
msgstr "A dwarven caravan is stuck on a washed-out road. The merchants offer blueprints or a share of the proceeds for help."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_DWARVEN_CARAVAN_OPTION_1"
msgstr "Buy a blueprint for 6 gold"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_DWARVEN_CARAVAN_OPTION_2"
msgstr "Help push the carts"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_DWARVEN_CARAVAN_OPTION_3"
msgstr "Continue on your way"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_DWARVEN_CARAVAN_RESULT_1"
msgstr "You receive the blueprint for «Deep Quarry»."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_DWARVEN_CARAVAN_RESULT_2"
msgstr "The caravan is saved, and the merchants pay generously."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_DWARVEN_CARAVAN_RESULT_3"
msgstr "A wheel breaks, and you have to pay for the repair."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_DWARVEN_CARAVAN_RESULT_4"
msgstr "You wish the merchants luck and leave."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_DWARVEN_CARAVAN_TITLE"
msgstr "Dwarven Caravan"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_GARGOYLE_RIDDLE_DESC"
msgstr "Stone gargoyles guard the bridge and demand you answer a riddle or pay a toll."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_GARGOYLE_RIDDLE_OPTION_1"
msgstr "Answer the riddle"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_GARGOYLE_RIDDLE_OPTION_2"
msgstr "Pay the masons 6 gold"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_GARGOYLE_RIDDLE_OPTION_3"
msgstr "Find another way"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_GARGOYLE_RIDDLE_RESULT_1"
msgstr "The gargoyles laugh and open a chest of gold."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_GARGOYLE_RIDDLE_RESULT_2"
msgstr "The answer is wrong, and the gargoyles take a penalty."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_GARGOYLE_RIDDLE_RESULT_3"
msgstr "The masons reinforce your Tower and distract the guardians."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_GARGOYLE_RIDDLE_RESULT_4"
msgstr "The detour takes time but preserves your supplies."

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_GARGOYLE_RIDDLE_TITLE"
msgstr "Riddle of the Gargoyles"

#. context: event
msgid "EVENT_HERMIT_TRAINING_DESC"
